    "body": "The example in the OP is good:\r\n\r\n```\r\n<picture>\r\n  <source srcset= \"green200x200.png\" width=\"100\"></source>\r\n  <img width=\"50\" height=\"10\">\r\n</picture>\r\n```\r\n\r\nWe want to end up with `width: 100px; height: auto; aspect-ratio: auto`. Otherwise you end up with `width: 100px; height: 10px; aspect-ratio: auto 50px / 10px;` which makes no sense.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
